  "_readme": [
    "Hand-curated spelling merges for generate_publication_data.py.",
    "",
    "The generator already folds together spellings that differ only by case,",
    "punctuation, spacing or a leading article, and given names that are a",
    "prefix of exactly one longer form. This file is for the rest: real typos,",
    "renamed venues and imprint variants, where no rule can tell a misspelling",
    "from a different entity without knowing the field.",
    "",
    "Each entry maps a variant to the form to keep. Add one only when the two",
    "are certainly the same thing. Near-identical names that are NOT the same,",
    "and must stay apart, include:",
    "  'Journal for Islamic Studies' (Cape Town) vs 'Journal of Islamic Studies' (Oxford)",
    "  'Islam in Africa' (book series) vs 'Islamic Africa' (journal)",
    "  'Journal of Global History' vs 'Journal of Social History'",
    "  'The Journal of Modern African Studies' vs 'The Journal of North African Studies'",
    "  'Springer' vs 'Springer VS' — distinct imprints of one group",
    "  'Oxford University Press' vs 'Oxford University Press Pakistan' — likewise",
    "  'Africa' vs 'Africa Today' vs 'Africa Spectrum' — three different journals"
